---
import Layout from '../layout/layout.astro';
const phoneNumber = "011-9712328";
const address = "Via Valobra 117/119, Carmagnola";
---

<Layout 
  title="Speedy Pizza"
  description="Speedy Pizza Carmagnola - La migliore pizza con consegna a domicilio e asporto. Ordina online o chiama per gustare le nostre pizze artigianali preparate con ingredienti freschi."
  type="website"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-slate-900 py-20 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-red-600 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-40 -left-20 w-72 h-72 bg-orange-500 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Benvenuti da <span class="text-red-500">Speedy Pizza!</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        La pizza più veloce e gustosa di Carmagnola. <br class="hidden md:block">
        <span class="text-white font-semibold">Consegna a domicilio (€2,00)</span> e asporto disponibili da {address}.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <a href="/menu" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-red-500/30 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center">
          Scopri il Menu
        </a>
        <a href={`tel:${phoneNumber.replace(/-/g, '')}`} class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>📞</span> Chiama per Ordinare
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white" id="about">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Chi Siamo</h2>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-red-500 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-orange-500 rounded-2xl opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-50 blur-lg transition-opacity duration-300"></div>
          <img src="/logo.jpeg" alt="Pizza appena sfornata da Speedy Pizza" class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-md mx-auto transform transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"/>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">
            Speedy Pizza nasce dalla passione per la vera pizza italiana, preparata con ingredienti freschi e di alta qualità.
          </p>
          <p>
            Situati nel cuore di Carmagnola, in {address}, ci impegniamo ogni giorno per offrirvi un'esperienza culinaria indimenticabile, con <strong class="text-red-600">consegna a domicilio (€2,00)</strong> o comodamente da portare via.
          </p>
          <p>
            Dalle classiche Margherite e Marinare alle nostre specialità della casa, ogni pizza è cotta alla perfezione. Offriamo un servizio rapido sia per l'asporto che per la consegna a domicilio.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg">
            <p class="font-bold text-red-800">
              Ordina la tua pizza preferita: la bontà di Speedy Pizza ti aspetta, direttamente a casa tua con soli €2,00 di consegna!
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50" id="contact">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Contattaci e Ordina</h2>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-red-500 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Address Card -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow p-8 text-center border border-slate-100 group">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            📍
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Dove Siamo</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">{address} (TO)</p>
          <span class="inline-block bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
            🚚 Consegna a domicilio (€2,00)
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Phone Card -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow p-8 text-center border border-slate-100 group">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            📞
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Ordinazioni</h3>
          <p class="mb-6">
            <a href={`tel:${phoneNumber.replace(/-/g, '')}`} class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">
              {phoneNumber}
            </a>
          </p>
          <a href={`tel:${phoneNumber.replace(/-/g, '')}`} class="inline-block w-full py-3 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg transition-colors">
            Chiama Ora
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Hours Card -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow p-8 text-center border border-slate-100 group">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🕐
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Orari</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-2">Lunedì - Domenica</p>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800">18:00 - 22:00</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
